From 42ed767aef2de806f1e3f1e384192555a5caf3ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AKT Security <security@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 05:43:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Security hardening: rate limiting, preview-only beats,
 security headers, safer auth

- Worker: D1-backed rate limits (login/register/audio/playlist writes/asset misses)
- Auth: uniform timing + responses for unknown emails, 10-session cap, correct expiry comparison, paid plan returned on login
- Audio: separate token secret, signed full/preview variant, beats preview-only unless active member, constant-time checks
- CSRF: strict origin check on all state-changing routes incl. playlists; JSON body size limits
- Headers: _headers (CSP, HSTS, XFO, COOP/CORP, Permissions-Policy) for the static site; headers on all API responses
- healthz minimal unless HEALTH_TOKEN supplied; asset endpoint no longer echoes input and avoids R2 listing on hits
- Remove apply-fix workflow (unreviewed zip -> push to main); ignore audio/zips/secrets
